 "system": {
  "description": "<p>You carry the makings for your traps.</p><ul><li>You may have up to three set at once; a trap lasts until it is sprung or you leave the area (a day at most).</li><li>A trap fills one <strong>5ft</strong> space; a snare or pit holds a creature up to Large, and a pit needs earth to dig.</li><li>A set trap is hidden: a creature spots it only if its passive awareness meets your Class Save DC, and a creature that searches finds it with a Wisdom check against the same DC.</li><li>A creature that steps into a trap's space springs it and makes the save against your Class Save DC.</li></ul>",
